<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 100,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 100,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's est receipts 100,000, Wk ago 79,000, and Yr ago 98,000 head at interior Iowa/so Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded steady to $1.00 higher than mid-session Friday. Trade was slow to moderate for moderate to good demand and light to moderate offerings. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
